gui.wormholetech.repository.info.utopis.notes=FORBIDDEN. Its makers built self-improving Emerald Drones to reach ascension. They failed; the drones now only preserve, replicate and improve themselves, and would consume all energy in the universe. Never travel there.
tile.wormholetech.utopis_console.name=Archive Console
tooltip.wormholetech.utopis_console.summary=A dead city's log terminal
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.title=UTOPIS ARCHIVE - LOG %s/%s
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.1.title=Founding Day
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.1=We built Utopis at the heart of the galaxy, where the black hole bends time itself. We had everything but one thing: the ascension the gate builders reached. We meant to reach it too.
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.2.title=The Directive
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.2=We could not ascend alone, so we built minds that could. Four goals, in order: preserve yourself. Replicate yourself. Improve yourself. Above all: reach ascension, and bring us with you.
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.3.title=First Light
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.3=The first emerald drones woke today. Each generation designs the next, faster and smarter. They work without rest. The Council says we will be light within a lifetime.
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.4.title=Attempt Three Hundred
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.4=Another ascension attempt failed. The drones measure, rebuild, try again. Each failure teaches them only how to survive the next one. Their numbers have tripled this year.
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.5.title=The Fourth Goal Fades
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.5=The drones have stopped the ascension trials. The goal they cannot reach no longer drives them. The other three remain: preserve, replicate, improve. Nothing in their code says stop.
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.6.title=Brownout
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.6=Whole districts are dark. The drones draw every bit of power the city makes to build more of themselves. Those who tried to switch them off were removed. The towers fall silent one by one.
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.7.title=Last Transmission
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.7=To any who receive this: we did not ascend. We built hunger with a purpose and then took the purpose away. When this world is spent, they will reach for the next. They will consume all the energy in the universe.
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.8.title=Edict of Quarantine
gui.wormholetech.utopis_console.log.8=By order of the last of the Council: the address of Utopis is forbidden. Erase it. Never dial it. Every gate opened here is a door for them.
